# ApexPost API Test Requests
# Usage: Open in VS Code with REST Client extension, or use with `dotnet-http-client`

@baseUrl = https://localhost:54402
@apiVersion = v2
@devTokenUrl = {{baseUrl}}/dev/token

### ============================================================================
### DEVELOPMENT TOKEN ENDPOINT (Development only)
### ============================================================================

# Get a development token for COURIER-001
POST {{devTokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierId": "COURIER-001",
  "role": "Courier"
}

### Get an admin token
# POST {{devTokenUrl}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "courierId": "ADMIN-001",
#   "role": "Admin"
# }

### ============================================================================
### VARIABLES - Set after getting token
### ============================================================================

@courierToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...  # Replace with actual token from response above
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...    # Replace with admin token
@partnerApiKey = your-partner-api-key-here               # Replace with actual API key from config

### ============================================================================
### SHIPMENT ENDPOINTS (v2 - requires Bearer token)
### ============================================================================

### Create shipment (AuthenticatedUser)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "APX-20241109",
  "weightKg": 2.5,
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "recipientPhone": "+15551234567",
  "recipientAddress": "123 Main St",
  "recipientCity": "Springfield",
  "recipientPostalCode": "62701",
  "recipientCountry": "US",
  "specialInstructions": "Leave at door",
  "declaredValue": 100.00
}

### Get shipment list (AuthenticatedUser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### Get single shipment (AuthenticatedUser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### Update shipment (AuthenticatedUser)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weightKg": 3.0,
  "recipientName": "Jane Doe",
  "recipientPhone": "+15551234567",
  "recipientAddress": "123 Main St",
  "recipientCity": "Springfield",
  "specialInstructions": "Call on arrival"
}

### Update shipment status - PickedUp (CourierOnly)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/status
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PickedUp",
  "reason": "Package picked up from sender",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 40.7128,
    "longitude": -74.0060
  }
}

### Update shipment status - InTransit (CourierOnly)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/status
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InTransit",
  "reason": "Departed sorting facility",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 40.7128,
    "longitude": -74.0060
  }
}

### Update shipment status - Delivered (CourierOnly, requires signature)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/status
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Delivered",
  "reason": "Delivered to recipient",
  "recipientSignature": "John Doe",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 40.7128,
    "longitude": -74.0060
  }
}

### Delete shipment (AdminOnly) - will fail with courier token (403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### Delete shipment (AdminOnly) - use admin token
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================================
### SCAN ENDPOINTS (v2 - requires Courier role + matching courierId)
### ============================================================================

### Upload scans (CourierOnly + courierId match)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    {
      "scanId": "scan::11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "courierId": "COURIER-001",
      "scanType": "Pickup",
      "location": "Warehouse A",
      "scannedAtUtc": "2024-11-09T10:00:00Z",
      "notes": "Package picked up from sender",
      "gpsCoordinates": {
        "latitude": 40.7128,
        "longitude": -74.0060
      },
      "recipientSignature": null
    },
    {
      "scanId": "scan::22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "courierId": "COURIER-001",
      "scanType": "InTransit",
      "location": "Sorting Facility",
      "scannedAtUtc": "2024-11-09T14:30:00Z",
      "notes": "Arrived at sorting facility",
      "gpsCoordinates": {
        "latitude": 40.7580,
        "longitude": -73.9855
      },
      "recipientSignature": null
    }
  ]
}

### Upload scans with WRONG courierId (should return 403)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/scans
# Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "scans": [
#     {
#       "scanId": "scan::33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
#       "courierId": "COURIER-999",  # Different from token's courierId
#       "scanType": "Pickup",
#       "location": "Warehouse B",
#       "scannedAtUtc": "2024-11-09T10:00:00Z",
#       "notes": "This should fail with 403"
#     }
#   ]
# }

### Get scan history (AuthenticatedUser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### ============================================================================
### PARTNER ENDPOINT (v2 only - requires X-Api-Key header)
### ============================================================================

### Valid API key (should succeed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/partner/shipments/APX-20241109
X-Api-Key: {{partnerApiKey}}

### Missing API key (should return 401)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/partner/shipments/APX-20241109

### Invalid API key (should return 401)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/partner/shipments/APX-20241109
# X-Api-Key: invalid-key-12345

### ============================================================================
### AUTHENTICATION/ AUTHORIZATION TEST CASES
### ============================================================================

### 401 - No token (should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109

### 401 - Expired/Invalid token (should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.invalid.token

### 403 - Courier token trying to DELETE (AdminOnly)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 403 - Courier token trying to upload scans for different courierId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    {
      "scanId": "scan::44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
      "courierId": "COURIER-999",
      "scanType": "Pickup",
      "location": "Test",
      "scannedAtUtc": "2024-11-09T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 403 - Non-courier trying to update status (requires Courier role)
# If you have a token with different role or no role claim
# PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/status
# Authorization: Bearer {{someOtherToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "status": "PickedUp"
# }

### ============================================================================
### VALIDATION ERROR TESTS (400 Bad Request)
### ============================================================================

### Invalid tracking number format
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "INVALID-FORMAT",
  "weightKg": 2.5,
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "recipientPhone": "+15551234567",
  "recipientAddress": "123 Main St",
  "recipientCity": "Springfield"
}

### Weight out of range
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "APX-20241110",
  "weightKg": 100,
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "recipientPhone": "+15551234567",
  "recipientAddress": "123 Main St",
  "recipientCity": "Springfield"
}

### Missing required fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "APX-20241111",
  "weightKg": 2.5
  // Missing recipientName, recipientPhone, recipientAddress, recipientCity
}

### Invalid scan type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    {
      "scanId": "scan::55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
      "courierId": "COURIER-001",
      "scanType": "InvalidType",
      "location": "Test",
      "scannedAtUtc": "2024-11-09T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### ============================================================================
### CONFLICT TESTS (409 Conflict)
### ============================================================================

### Duplicate tracking number
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "APX-20241109",  # Already created above
  "weightKg": 2.5,
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "recipientPhone": "+15551234567",
  "recipientAddress": "123 Main St",
  "recipientCity": "Springfield"
}

### Invalid status transition
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109/status
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Delivered",  # Can't go directly from Created to Delivered
  "recipientSignature": "John Doe"
}

### Delete non-Created shipment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================================
### NOT FOUND TESTS (404 Not Found)
### ============================================================================

### Non-existent shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments/APX-99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### Non-existent partner shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/partner/shipments/APX-99999999
X-Api-Key: {{partnerApiKey}}

### ============================================================================
### UNSUPPORTED MEDIA TYPE (415)
### ============================================================================

### Wrong content type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not JSON

### ============================================================================
### VERSIONING TESTS
### ============================================================================

### v1 endpoint (deprecated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### v2 endpoint (current)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### Version is chosen by the URL segment only (header/query versioning is not enabled).
### An unversioned path is a 404 problem details response:
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/APX-20241109
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### ============================================================================
### HEALTH CHECK (no auth required)
### ============================================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================================================
### OPENAPI DOCS (Development only)
### ============================================================================

### OpenAPI v1
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### OpenAPI v2
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v2.json

### Swagger UI (viewer only; reads /openapi/v1.json and /openapi/v2.json)
# Open in browser: {{baseUrl}}/swagger